meta {
  name: Get Cart
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/cart
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Cart-Token: {{CART_TOKEN}}
}

docs {
  # GET /api/v1/cart

  The shopper's open cart.

  - No `Authorization` header: anonymous cart. Send `X-Cart-Token` from a previous add. Without a token this returns an empty cart and does not create one.
  - `Authorization: Bearer`: the logged-in account's cart. If `X-Cart-Token` is also sent, that anonymous cart is merged into the account and the token stops working.
  - A bad bearer token is rejected. It is not treated as a guest.

  Price, delivery (৳70), and total are computed on the server. The anonymous secret is returned only as `cart_token` to the shopper who holds it.
}
